  "description": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to bring to the market this exceptional, expansive family home at 5 Stonemason Road is fully repainted and offers a bright, fresh, and modern living experience in Lusk. Perfect location, the property is beautifully configured with multiple living zones, generous bedroom spaces, and fresh finishes throughout. Move-in ready and immaculately presented.\nAccommodation & Layout\n• 3 Double Bedrooms (including a spacious master bedroom featuring its own private en suite)\n• 1 Single Bedroom (ideal for a child's room or a dedicated home office)\n• 2 Large Living Rooms (offering excellent flexibility for formal entertainment and separate family relaxation space)\n• Full Fitted Kitchen (featuring modern appliances and ample storage/dining space)\n• Main Bathroom (well-appointed family bathroom upstairs)\n• Downstairs WC (convenient guest toilet on the ground floor)\nKey Features\n• Freshly painted throughout in contemporary neutral tones\n• Generous floor plan with two separate reception rooms\n• Exceptional natural light across all floors\n• Situated in a quiet, accessible, and highly sought-after development in Lusk\nTerms\n• Rent: €3,700 per month\n• Security Deposit: One month's rent\n• References required upon application\nEmail though this advert to arrange a viewing.\n",
